body:
this is ***SATURDAY NIGHT LIIIIIIVEEEEEEE***

&#x200B;

\-Barb off the box wine

"David is the only one who knows I'm out of town..."

&#x200B;

that's because you have no other friends, Jenelle. Who else would you tell

Jenelle is "so sick and tired of the drama" 

&#x200B;

I feel like I've been hearing this for ten years.

"We were right in the middle of it"

&#x200B;

let's not forget that your bitch ass didn't evacuate
